From 1ff5ad5b0c0a780081a8d6f90748c9c9df08e26d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Alberto Gallegos <alberto.gallegos.muro@intel.com>
Date: Thu, 9 Jul 2026 18:28:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add XPU support to FBGEMM sparse ops tests

Add XPU device support to misc_ops_test.py and permute_sparse_features_test.py.
Includes support for permute_1D_sparse_data and permute_2D_sparse_data operators.
Also adds XPU support to cumsum_test.py for asynchronous_complete_cumsum,
asynchronous_exclusive_cumsum, and asynchronous_inclusive_cumsum operators.
Also adds XPU support to block_bucketize_test.py for the
block_bucketize_sparse_features and block_bucketize_sparse_features_inference
operators.

Signed-off-by: Alberto Gallegos <alberto.gallegos.muro@intel.com>
---
